{"term": {"label": "義", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-i", "title": "梁惠王上", "description": "孟子見梁惠王。王曰：「叟不遠千里而來，亦將有以利吾國乎？」\n孟子對曰：「王何必曰利？亦有仁義而已矣。王曰『何以利吾國』？大夫曰『何以利吾家』？士庶人曰『何以利吾身』？上下交征利而國危矣。萬乘之國弒其君者，必千乘之家；千乘之國弒其君者，必百乘之家。萬取千焉，千取百焉，不為不多矣。苟為後義而先利，不奪不饜。未有仁而遺其親者", "occurrences": 7, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "乘", "id": "乘"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "使", "id": "使"}, {"form": "兵", "id": "兵"}, {"form": "刑", "id": "刑"}, {"form": "利", "id": "利"}, {"form": "制", "id": "制"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "孝悌", "id": "孝悌"}, {"form": "家", "id": "家"}, {"form": "後", "id": "後"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "敵", "id": "敵"}, {"form": "日", "id": "日"}, {"form": "樂", "id": "樂"}, {"form": "步", "id": "步"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "甲", "id": "甲"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "義", "variants": [], "id": "義"}, {"form": "賢者", "id": "賢者"}, {"form": "身", "id": "身"}, {"form": "魚", "id": "魚"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.3862943611198906, "source": "政", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 1.2321436812926323, "source": "政", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 2.4849066497880004, "source": "政", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.665748206371831, "source": "政", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 1.2321436812926323, "source": "天下", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 1.0712133144799951, "source": "天下", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 1.791759469228055, "source": "天下", "target": "使"}, {"weight": 2.1972245773362196, "source": "天下", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.302585092994046, "source": "制", "target": "使"}, {"weight": 2.70805020110221, "source": "制", "target": "兵"}, {"weight": 2.0149030205422647, "source": "制", "target": "利"}, {"weight": 2.995732273553991, "source": "制", "target": "甲"}, {"weight": 1.742969305058623, "source": "制", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 2.0149030205422647, "source": "身", "target": "利"}, {"wei